	(text "Strobes (STP19NE06L, low side): +18 V -> 22 k -> LED -> strobe, sensed like the coils.\nColumns (VN02N high side, 18 V): column -> 10 k -> LED -> GND (1.6 mA, keeps the VN02N out of open-load) + divider.\nJ13 per the SAM schematic: +18 V on pin 9, columns on 1, 3-8 and 10. JP1/JP2 (bridged 1-2 by default) swap pins 9 and 10\nif a board turns out to be wired the other way (Vincent's Databus-Analysis table, see ARCHITECTURE.md Q16)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb2bacf2-bd28-5d1f-80a3-8375c286376b")
	)
